        "Description": "Helen west fronts that she is a sweet grandma but in reality she runs an illeagal drug ring in denver that she built up. In her freetime she gives out cookies laced with cocaine and trace amounts of opiods such as morphine and in some lethal cases fentanyl. Lissy and James knows about this and hasnt opend up about so to prevent several deaths so they are also targets. This was orginally an fbi case but was handed to us as it is a international matter. Be sure to check the basement to find leads",
